<section id="hero" class="bg-primary bg-gradient text-white text-center py-5">
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Find a room or list one </h1>
    <p>Roomies is a platform where people who have a free room in a shared house or apartment can offer it to people looking for a place to live. The host publishes the room with the necessary details for seekers to apply, visit, and move in. </p>
    <a href="#busqueda" class="btn btn-light fw-normal">Find a room</a>
    <%= link_to "Publish a room", new_listing_path, class: "btn btn-light fw-normal" %>
</section>
           
<section id="funcionamiento"  class="container">
    <h2 class=" fw-bold" >How it works</h2>
    <ul >
        <li>
            <h3>Publish</h3>
            <p>A host when register a property, describes the apartment or house in whitch the room is, also what the room itself has, the financial details and finally the household rules</p>                        
        </li>
        <li>
            <h3>Apply</h3>
            <p>The seeker can apply to a published listing. The application must contain a message introducing themselves, the date they would like to move in, and how long they intend to stay. The application follows a lifecycle which could be: pending, shortlisted, accepted, rejected, and withdrawn. A seeker may not apply twice to the same listing.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h3>Visit and Move In</h3>
            <p>Once the application is shortlisted, the host arranges a visit to the property on a given date and time. After the visit takes place, it is marked as completed. When the application is accepted, the others are instantly rejected and the listing moves to reserved.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>
            

<section id="opciones" class="container py-5">
    <h2 class="text-center fw-bold">Featured listings</h2>

    <% if @listings.empty? %>
        <p>No published listings are available.</p>
    <% else %>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <%= render @listings %>
        </div>
    <% end %>
</section>

<section id="busqueda"
         class="container py-5"
         data-controller="search"
         data-search-url-value="<%= api_v1_listings_path %>">

  <h2 class="text-center">Search</h2>

  <%= form_with url: listings_path,
        method: :get,
        class: "row g-3",
        data: {
          search_target: "form",
          action: "submit->search#search"
        } do |form| %>

    <div class="col-md-4">
      <%= form.label :neighborhood_id, "Neighborhood", class: "form-label" %>
      <%= form.collection_select :neighborhood_id,
            Neighborhood.order(:name),
            :id,
            :name,
            { prompt: "All neighborhoods" },
            { class: "form-select" } %>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
      <%= form.label :max_rent, "Maximum rent (CLP)", class: "form-label" %>
      <%= form.number_field :max_rent,
            min: 0,
            step: 0.01,
            placeholder: "350000",
            class: "form-control" %>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
      <%= form.label :move_in_date, "Move-in date", class: "form-label" %>
      <%= form.date_field :move_in_date, class: "form-control" %>
    </div>

    <div class="col-12">
      <%= form.submit "Search",
            class: "btn btn-primary",
            data: {
              search_target: "submit",
              turbo_submits_with: "Searching..."
            } %>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <p class="text-muted mt-3"
     data-search-target="message"
     role="status"
     aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="row g-4"
       data-search-target="results"
       aria-busy="false"></div>
</section>